51670646667,"width":94.024999999999977,"height":34}},{"text":"Suppose that Maria is someone interested in this course of surgeries. She is a very cautious person, and decides to have the synthetic replacements occur very gradually. First, she has individual clumps of neurons replaced, until her brain is now replaced with a synthetic structure. Second, she has individual body parts replaced, one by one.  ","targetRectangle":{"y":14.684986114501953,"x":146.11177062988281,"width":781.18896484375,"height":160}},{"text":"It is instructive to think about how AI has progressed since Deep Blue.","targetRectangle":{"y":-618.76190185546875,"x":113.53816070556661,"width":778.9499999999997,"height":34}},{"text":"Let’s call this procedure slow gradual destructive uploading. It is destructive because Maria’s neurons (and other parts of her body) are destroyed as they are replaced. It is gradual because this happens, not all at once, but one by one. It is slow because it takes place over a long period of time. ","targetRectangle":{"y":202.34634399414062,"x":129.62694549560547,"width":773.05908203125,"height":162.1484375}},{"text":"Day ","targetRectangle":{"y":640.1099853515625,"x":-707.2820204734802,"width":50.5,"height":34}},{"text":"1","targetRectangle":{"y":674.1099853515625,"x":-692.45702047348027,"width":13.900000000000091,"height":34}},{"text":"Let’s call the outcome of this procedure “Digi-Maria.” It seems plausible that Maria could survive this process; so it seems plausible that Maria=Digi-Maria.","targetRectangle":{"y":392.15615844726562,"x":136.95116424560547,"width":758.41064453125,"height":96}},{"text":"Our discussion so far suggests:","targetRectangle":{"y":513.7559814453125,"x":343.35128784179688,"width":319.32373046875,"height":32}},{"text":"2 ","targetRectangle":{"y":629.41949462890625,"x":-342.66911561489104,"width":20.849999999999966,"height":34}},{"text":"years","targetRectangle":{"y":663.41949462890625,"x":-364.65661561489105,"width":57.875,"height":34}}],"bas